      "title": "Benefits dependents detail",
      "type": "array",
      "x-jsf-presentation": {
        "description": "<ol> <li>Do <strong>not</strong> fill out this section if your dependents have been enrolled with another insured unit.</li> <li>If your dependent recently completed R.O.C household registration (except for Taiwan National who has previously subscribed to this Insurance within the last 2 years and new-born baby), he/she shall establish a registered domicile for at least 6 consecutive months in the Taiwan area prior to subscription of this Insurance.<br/>For dependent with newly R.O.C domicile registration or new born baby (Taiwan National), please provide supporting document household registration copy.</li> <li>If your dependent is a foreigner, overseas Chinese, Mainland Chinese, or Hong Kong/Macao citizen, he/she shall have proof of legal residence (e.g Alien Residence Certificate) and have resided for at least 6 consecutive months in the Taiwan area prior to subscription of this Insurance.</li> </ol>",
        "inputType": "group-array"
